cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these lessons or their code, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Transformers from scratch to production"
abstract: >-
  A course in ten notebooks that run on the free GPUs of Kaggle and Colab. It builds an English-to-Russian translator
  with a Transformer written from scratch in PyTorch, then evaluates, tunes, packages and serves it and ships it as a
  reproducible Docker image.
